  heroes  pending
  go      DiffMatchPatch.PatchMake, DiffMatchPatch.PatchApply, DiffMatchPatch.PatchToText, DiffMatchPatch.PatchFromText, DiffMatchPatch.PatchAddContext, DiffMatchPatch.PatchAddPadding, DiffMatchPatch.PatchSplitMax, DiffMatchPatch.PatchDeepCopy, DiffMatchPatch.PatchDeleteThreshold, DiffMatchPatch.PatchMargin, Patch, Patch.String
  rust    -
  python  -
  note    `patch`'s work: reading the hunks back and placing them where the text has moved; not done in this round

capability match/fuzzy  where a short text best stands in a long one, near a place, allowing errors
  heroes  refused: go-diff's Bitap search serves its patches alone; `regex` and `strings` search, and `ratio` scores a candidate
  go      DiffMatchPatch.MatchMain, DiffMatchPatch.MatchBitap, DiffMatchPatch.MatchAlphabet, DiffMatchPatch.MatchThreshold, DiffMatchPatch.MatchDistance, DiffMatchPatch.MatchMaxBits
